<?php /** @var list<array<string,mixed>> $rows */ /** @var int $total */ /** @var int $page */ /** @var int $perPage */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $filters */ /** @var array<string,mixed> $qs */ /** @var array<string,int> $dash */ use Vertex\Core\View;
$sel = static fn (string $a, string $b): string => $a === $b ? ' selected' : ''; ?>
<div class="page-head"><div><p class="eyebrow">Referral partners</p><h1>Commission ledger</h1></div><div class="actions"><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/commissions/rules">Rules</a><a class="btn btn-ghost" href="/referrals/dashboard">Dashboard</a></div></div>
<div class="stat-grid"><a class="stat" href="/commissions?review=1"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['awaiting_review'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Awaiting review</span></a><div class="stat"><span class="stat-n"><?= e(money($dash['eligible_balance_minor'] ?? 0)) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Payable balance</span></div>
    <a class="stat" href="/commissions?status=on_hold"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['on_hold'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">On hold</span></a><div class="stat"><span class="stat-n"><?= (int) ($dash['adjustments'] ?? 0) ?> / <?= (int) ($dash['reversals'] ?? 0) ?></span><span class="stat-l">Adjustments / reversals</span></div></div>
<form method="get" action="/commissions" class="toolbar" role="search"><div class="field"><label for="q">Search</label><input id="q" name="q" type="search" maxlength="100" placeholder="Reference, partner, project" value="<?= e($filters['q']) ?>"></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="s">Status</label><select id="s" name="status"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('referrals.commission_statuses') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['status'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="m">Milestone</label><select id="m" name="milestone"><option value="">All</option><?php foreach (config('referrals.milestone_labels') as $c => $l) : ?><option value="<?= e($c) ?>"<?= $sel($filters['milestone'], $c) ?>><?= e($l) ?></option><?php endforeach; ?></select></div>
    <div class="field"><label for="from">From</label><input id="from" name="from" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['from']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><label for="to">To</label><input id="to" name="to" type="date" value="<?= e($filters['to']) ?>"></div><div class="field"><button class="btn btn-ghost" type="submit">Filter</button></div></form>
<div class="table-wrap"><table class="table"><thead><tr><th>Entry</th><th>Partner</th><th>Referral</th><th>Project</th><th>Milestone</th><th class="num">Rate</th><th class="num">Base</th><th class="num">Amount</th><th>Status</th></tr></thead><tbody>
    <?php foreach ($rows as $e) : ?><tr><td><a href="/commissions/<?= e($e['public_id']) ?>"><strong><?= e($e['reference']) ?></strong></a></td><td><?= e($e['partner_name']) ?></td><td><?= e($e['referral_reference']) ?></td><td><?= e($e['project_code'] ?? '—') ?></td>
        <td><?= e(config("referrals.milestone_labels.{$e['milestone']}", $e['milestone'])) ?></td><td class="num"><?= e(rtrim(rtrim(number_format((int) $e['rate_bps'] / 100, 2), '0'), '.')) ?>%</td><td class="num"><?= e(money($e['base_minor'])) ?></td><td class="num"><?= e(money($e['amount_minor'])) ?></td><td><?= View::partial('pbadge', ['kind' => 'commission', 's' => $e['status']]) ?></td></tr><?php endforeach; ?>
    <?php if ($rows === []) : ?><tr><td colspan="9" class="muted">No commission entries match.</td></tr><?php endif; ?></tbody></table></div>
<?= View::partial('pagination', ['page' => $page, 'perPage' => $perPage, 'total' => $total, 'filters' => $qs]) ?>
